#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:238
msgid ""
"Charges the statutory deposit on beverages in covered packaging, in force in "
"Poland since 1 October 2025. Mark the packaging on each product; the deposit "
"is then added on top of the price as its own checkout line and shown on the "
"product page. It is added untaxed on purpose: the deposit sits outside the "
"VAT base at the point of sale. Off by default."
msgstr ""

